*  mrbp_result_control.sno - CONTROL for the START-δ/RESULT capture family (s71).
*  A whole-pattern value capture over a stored pattern with NO deferred component.
*  fc_walk_range admits every kind here, so sno_cap_fc REGISTERS the pair and the
*  capture gets its fc cell (measured: SAVE save_active=1, COND fc_disp=0).
*  Manual p.128: "(SUBJECT ? PATTERN) performs pattern matching and returns the
*  substring matched, or failure as its value."
*  THIS MUST STAY GREEN.  It is the sibling that proves the value form itself works;
*  if it ever reddens, the defect moved out of the defer class and into the base path.
        Q = LEN(3)
        S = 'ABCDEF'
        V = (S ? Q)
        OUTPUT = 'V=[' V ']'
END
